    wm_scene_css_render_perf, 1, "OWNER QUESTION 2026-11-04 (slice H): CSS chrome capped at WM_SCENE_CSS_RENDER_PIXEL_CAP=10000 px (wm_scene.spl) under the interpreter. Accept the cap for 1.0.0 (native path only), or require a perf budget spec (explicit ms at 1024x768) before release? Needs an agreed budget number."
